2414..2488 Comment "/// Spinning undoes winding at every loop (cubical\'s `decodeEncode` at the"
2489..2563 Comment "/// point): the round trip at a variable, by induction over the words. The"
2564..2642 Comment "/// result type reads the word the fold descends on, so each arm answers it at"
2643..2714 Comment "/// its letter and the recursive call at the rest: `sect[<](q)` relates"
2715..2790 Comment "/// `spin(wind(q))` to `q`, and carried along `loopOn` it relates `loop ∷"
2791..2871 Comment "/// spin(wind(q))`, which `spin(wind(loop ∷ q))` runs to, to `loop ∷ q`. The"
2872..2948 Comment "/// case respects the cancellations: at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the arms"
2949..3031 Comment "/// compose to `Path.ap(loopOn, Path.ap(unloopOn, p))`, whose functions compose to"
3032..3104 Comment "/// the identity under the words\' rules, so the chain is `p` itself, the"
3105..3123 Comment "/// answer at `q`."
